# render-size colour/depth targets (colourTargets=0, depthTargets=0), so pickInputs
# fails and there is nothing to feed DLSS. This is not a world-event gate: the gate is
# gone; the title screen simply has no inputs until a world has been loaded once.

## 4. Observations recorded, not fixed here

# - Slight vertical judder in the menu while the background rotates. The menu panorama
#   is not a world render (its temporal signal is not reliable); the current path keeps
#   accumulating history there. Candidate fix (EXP-0071): force DLSS Reset while
#   !worldLoaded(), i.e. spatial-only in the menu.
# - The title screen cannot be injected until one world has been entered in the process
#   (no render-size colour/depth inventory). Not blocking; documented here.
